{"sha": "b7e96a975bf8b2ac7fa310182c5e142c93b728bcf023141d43ccb0ba963f4fba", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{1.} 设 $A \\in \\R$。由 $u_n \\to +\\infty$，存在 $N$，使得", "$u_n \\geq A$（$n \\geq N$）；必要时增大 $N$，可得", "$v_n \\geq u_n \\geq A$（$n \\geq N$）。", "", "\\emph{2.} 设 $\\varepsilon > 0$。从某项起，两式", "$\\ell - \\varepsilon \\leq u_n$ 与 $w_n \\leq \\ell + \\varepsilon$ 均成立，于是", "$\\ell - \\varepsilon \\leq u_n \\leq v_n \\leq w_n \\leq \\ell + \\varepsilon$，即", "$\\abs{v_n - \\ell} \\leq \\varepsilon$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "对所有 $n \\geq 1$，$-\\frac{1}{n} \\leq \\frac{(-1)^n}{n} \\leq \\frac{1}{n}$，且", "两界都趋于 $0$；因此 $\\frac{(-1)^n}{n} \\to 0$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[单调收敛定理]\\label{thm:g12:seq:monotone}", "递增且有上界的数列收敛。递减", "且有下界的数列收敛。递增且无", "上界的数列趋于 $+\\infty$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[部分证明]", "证明第三条结论。设 $(u_n)$ 递增且无", "上界，设 $A \\in \\R$。由于 $A$ 不是上界，存在 $N$，", "使得 $u_N \\geq A$；由单调性，$u_n \\geq u_N \\geq A$ 对所有 $n \\geq N$ 成立。", "因此 $u_n \\to +\\infty$。", "", "前两条结论依赖于", "$\\R$ 的确界原理；它们\\emph{在本阶段不加证明地承认}（并于", "本科一年级证明）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "定理保证了极限的\\emph{存在性}，但未给出", "其值。递增且以 $M$ 为上界的数列收敛于某个", "$\\ell \\leq M$，但不一定收敛于 $M$。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[等比数列的极限]\\label{thm:g12:seq:geometric}", "设 $q \\in \\R$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $q > 1$，则 $q^n \\to +\\infty$。", "  \\item 若 $q = 1$，则 $q^n \\to 1$。", "  \\item 若 $\\abs{q} < 1$，则 $q^n \\to 0$。", "  \\item 若 $q \\leq -1$，则 $(q^n)$ 发散，无极限。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "\\emph{1.} 记 $q = 1 + a$，其中 $a > 0$。由伯努利不等式", "（\\cref{ex:g12:seq:bernoulli}）得 $q^n \\geq 1 + na \\to +\\infty$，再", "由比较定理（\\cref{thm:g12:seq:squeeze}）即得结论。", "", "\\emph{2.} 显然。", "", "\\emph{3.} 若 $q = 0$，结论显然。否则由 $\\abs{q} < 1$ 得", "$1/\\abs{q} > 1$，故由第 1 点，$(1/\\abs{q})^n \\to +\\infty$，因此", "$\\abs{q}^n \\to 0$，且 $-\\abs{q}^n \\leq q^n \\leq \\abs{q}^n$，于是", "由夹逼定理即得结论。", "", "\\emph{4.} 当 $q \\leq -1$ 时，$(q^{2n})$ 的项都 $\\geq 1$，而", "$(q^{2n+1})$ 的项都 $\\leq -1$：", "两子列不可能收敛于同一极限。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=10cm, height=5.6cm,", "  xlabel={$n$}, ylabel={$q^n$},", "  xmin=-0.5, xmax=13, ymin=-1.3, ymax=4.3,", "  xtick={5,10}, ytick={-1,1}]", "  \\addplot[omThm, only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.5pt,", "    samples at={0,...,6}] {1.25^x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.5pt,", "    samples at={0,...,12}] {0.75^x};", "  \\addplot[omProp, only marks, mark=*, mark size=1.5pt,", "    samples at={0,...,12}] {(-0.8)^x};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:6.3,3.7) {$q=1.25$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:3.4,0.55) {$q=0.75$};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\small, anchor=north] at (axis cs:7,-0.75) {$q=-0.8$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small $(q^n)$ 的三种行为：发散至 $+\\infty$（$q > 1$，红色）；", "收敛于 $0$（$\\abs q < 1$，蓝色）；", "以及阻尼振荡 --- 仍收敛于 $0$ --- 对应 $-1 < q < 0$（橙色）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[递推数列 $u_{n+1} = f(u_n)$]\\label{met:g12:seq:recurrent}", "研究由 $u_{n+1} = f(u_n)$ 定义的数列时：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 用归纳法证明 $(u_n)$ 始终落在区间 $I$ 上，", "        $f$ 在该区间上性质良好（并且常常还可证明 $(u_n)$ 单调）；", "  \\item 由单调收敛定理推出收敛；", "  \\item 在关系式 $u_{n+1} = f(u_n)$ 两边取极限：若 $f$", "        连续，且 $u_n \\to \\ell \\in I$，则 $\\ell$ 满足", "        $f(\\ell) = \\ell$（见\\cref{ch:g12:limcont}）；解此方程，", "        并选出正确的根。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.4cm, height=6.4cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=3.1, ymin=-0.4, ymax=2.7,", "  xtick={0,1.414,1.848}, xticklabels={$u_0$,$u_1$,$u_2$}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, domain=-0.3:2.6] {x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-0.4:2.9] {sqrt(x+2)};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (axis cs:0,0) -- (axis cs:0,1.414)", "    -- (axis cs:1.414,1.414) -- (axis cs:1.414,1.848)", "    -- (axis cs:1.848,1.848) -- (axis cs:1.848,1.961)", "    -- (axis cs:1.961,1.961);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:1.414,0) -- (axis cs:1.414,1.414);", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:1.848,0) -- (axis cs:1.848,1.848);", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,2) circle (1.5pt)", "    node[below right, font=\\small] {$\\ell = 2$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small, above left] at (axis cs:2.75,2.18)", "    {$y = f(x)$};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\small, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:1.08,0.82)", "    {$y = x$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}